Subject: [PATCH] library: add a panorama compact grid display mode

Compact grid draws the title over the cover. The new mode keeps that and
applies the same panorama layout as panorama comfortable grid: a cover whose
height/width is at most 0.75 is drawn 3:2, cells flow in a staggered grid so
a wide cover does not stretch the row, and auto columns use a 168 dp minimum.
A fixed column count stays fixed. Cover orientation is remembered per manga,
and an unknown cover in this mode is assumed wide.

The mode serializes as COMPACT_GRID_PANORAMA and is listed immediately after
compact grid in the library display settings and in the browse and related
display menus. The toolbar icon stays the grid icon used by compact grid.
Cover-only grid is unchanged.

Harmony-only: Mihon is adding the same mode in parallel; Animeko has no library display-mode grid.
